# Desolace (34-36): the Horde quests of Shadowprey Village and Ghost Walker Post, the first Gelkis
# quests and the Gizelton Caravan, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/desolace_34_36.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Desolace, area 405).
# The quest list is section 15 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md. The later Desolace quests
# (Kormek's Hut, the Valley of Spears, Mannoroc Coven, the Valley of Bones and Shen'dralas) are in
# Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43).
#
# The centaur clans: the Gelkis and the Magram are enemies, every quest for one costs reputation
# with the other (Buying Friendship: Gelkis sets the Magram to -15000), and both start at Neutral
# 2000. This guide sides with the Gelkis, as Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43) does: Carved Centaur
# Totems (93225) and Buying Friendship: Gelkis (94873), then Gelkis Alliance (1368), Stealing
# Supplies (1370) and Ongeku (1373).
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack them): The Kolkar of Desolace (1362, from Regthar Deathgate
#   in the Barrens), Alliance Relations (1432, from Keldran in Orgrimmar) and Family Tree (5361,
#   from Cliffwatcher Longhorn at Freewind Post, Thousand Needles).
# Left to later guides: Hunting in Stranglethorn (5763), handed in by Stranglethorn Vale (36-37);
#   Ongeku (1373): Ongeku, who drops the Draenethyst Shard, is in the Swamp of Sorrows.
# Left out:
# - The Magram side: Magram Alliance (1367), Broken Tears (1369), Gizmo for Warug (1371), Khan Shaka
#   (1375), A New Need for Shadow Protection (92754) and Big, No, MASSIVE Iron Axes (92818) need a
#   Friendly Magram reputation, which siding with the Gelkis rules out.
# - Khan Jehn (1374) and Valley of Bones (93034) follow Ongeku (1373), handed in only after the
#   Swamp of Sorrows; Test Your Theory (93045) follows A Cleansing Cry (93044), an Alliance quest.
# Bought, not farmed: the Greater Mystic Essences (Halea) and the White Bandit Mask (Molkar) are
#   crafted, nothing in Desolace drops them; the auction house stop is at the start, in Thunder Bluff.
#
# The route: Thunder Bluff (the auction house, if you pass it) and Shadowprey Village; Ghost Walker
# Post and the Kodo Graveyard; north to Ethel Rethor and Thunder Axe Fortress; north-east to the
# Kolkar Village and Sargeron, and south with the Gizelton Caravan; the Gelkis Village, Mannoroc
# Coven with the caravan, the Magram Village; back to the Gelkis and Shadowprey; up the west coast
# (the Drysnap crabs, the clams, the Slitherblade naga); Ghost Walker Post; the hearthstone to
# Shadowprey and a flight to Orgrimmar, where the next guide's zeppelin leaves.

guide Desolace (34-36)
faction horde
levels 34 36
carry 1106 1136 1362 1432 1712 1714 5361 5762
leave 1106 1136 1373 1712 1714 5762 5763
next Stranglethorn Vale (36-37)

# Thunder Bluff: the auction house, if you pass it --------------------------------------------------

map Thunder Bluff
ah 93225.1 npc 8674
tip Passing through Thunder Bluff? Five Carved Centaur Totems are cheap here; else the centaurs drop them.
note "Buy 3 Greater Mystic Essences and a White Bandit Mask at the auction house, for two Gelkis quests" npc 8674
tip Nothing in Desolace drops them; an enchanter or a tailor can make them instead. Without them, skip Halea's and Molkar's quests.

# Shadowprey Village ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Desolace
goto "Fly to Shadowprey Village, on the west coast of Desolace" at 21.6,74.1 r 30
tip No flight path to Shadowprey yet? Fly to Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains and ride south-west into Desolace, then on to the coast.
fpath 6726
accept 6142
tip Mai'Lahii sells fishing supplies inside a hut of the village.
accept 6143
accept 5763
tip Roon sends his horn to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn Vale: keep it, the next guide hands it in.
bind 11106
accept 5381
tip Taiga gives you the Demon Pick for the crystal in Thunder Axe Fortress.
accept 97265

