do 5561 at 51.5,59.0 mobs 4700 4701 4702 icon use "Tame 5 kodos with the Kodo Kombobulator and lead each one back to Smeed"
tip Use the kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the Kodo Graveyard west of Smeed; it follows you. Talk to it by Smeed, then fetch the next.
turnin 5561

